WEBVTT

00:08:29.613 --> 00:08:31.176
In England --

00:08:31.978 --> 00:08:34.883
I was about to say in the UK,
but in England --

00:08:34.907 --> 00:08:36.649
(Laughter)

00:08:36.673 --> 00:08:40.987
(Applause)

00:08:41.363 --> 00:08:45.449
In England, the leading rugby team,
or one of the leading rugby teams,

00:08:45.473 --> 00:08:46.833
is Saracens.

00:08:47.299 --> 00:08:52.364
The manager and the coach there realized
that all the physical training they do

00:08:52.388 --> 00:08:55.102
and the data-driven
conditioning that they do

00:08:55.126 --> 00:08:56.280
has become generic;

00:08:56.304 --> 00:08:59.094
really, all the teams
do exactly the same thing.

00:08:59.683 --> 00:09:02.015
So they risked an experiment.